{"id":"00246","root":"uni00246_1","name":{"ja":"井河　さくら","en":"Igawa Sakura"},"title":{"ja":"【天真影傑】","en":"【The Pure Hero of Shadows】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【天真影傑】 井河　さくら","en":"【The Pure Hero of Shadows】 Igawa Sakura"},"aliases":["Demon Sakura"],"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-09-30","limited":false,"characterId":27,"profile":{"ja":"アサギの妹。いつも明るく陽気で人懐っこい印象の美女。当初、アサギには対魔忍となる事を反対されていたが、姉のように正義のために戦いたいとアサギの反対を押し切って対魔忍となる。その後、カオス・アリーナ、東京キングダムでの死闘ではよく姉を助け、目立たないが優秀な対魔忍として、その名を上げるまでに。姉同様、カオス・アリーナで淫らな改造を受けたが桐生の手によって治癒。現在は五車学園で教師を務めている。得物は忍者小太刀の二刀流。","en":"Igawa Asagi's younger sister. Always bright, cheerful, and friendly, she gives the impression of a beautiful woman. At first, Asagi opposed her becoming a Taimanin, but Sakura pushed past her sister's objections, wanting to fight for justice like her sister, and became a Taimanin. Since then, in the deadly battles of Chaos Arena and Tokyo Kingdom, she often came to her sister's aid, and though she stays low-key, she proved herself an outstanding Taimanin, raising her name. Like her sister, she underwent lewd modifications in the Chaos Arena but was healed by Kiryu's hands. She now serves as a teacher at Gosha Academy. Her weaponry is a dual-wielded ninja short-sword style."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"黒岩心々","forms":[{"id":"uni00246_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1152,2304],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[178,356],"def":[135,270],"spd":[84,84],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","340004"]},{"id":"uni00246_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1704,3408],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[281,562],"def":[195,390],"spd":[84,84],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","340004","340005"]},{"id":"uni00246_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2256,4503],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[384,771],"def":[255,509],"spd":[84,84],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","340004","340005","340006"]}],"sk